{"title":"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two rays with common endpoint <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> forms a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919bf5d461970fc8d905d63704ef763c08594184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> angle. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> lies on one ray, point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> on the other ray, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a649aee592a9c37d2f9b5d5239f5e06e533130.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />. The maximum possible length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/0964c9cf406ef8e5ec8beaa6a92125f2d8f90460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae2fc6de4af170e698ad092660be78f1db98096.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ 1 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ \\frac {1 + \\sqrt {3}}{\\sqrt 2} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ \\sqrt{3} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 2 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3}} }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"425\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1e220396bf8f6704ea4a5f1745cc64ce339090b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OAB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> has the property that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e53622548c70b094d3e107144af96abe2cde0f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle O=30^{\\circ}$\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/4/4e4e71e9c0786b12fb9b4b5c67364147ed6e402f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>From the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Sines\" title=\"Law of Sines\">Law of Sines</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0be71299f6024c86c7689fff9667a7aa01ce78b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sin{\\angle A}}{OB}=\\frac{\\sin{\\angle O}}{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"135\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/6/1968e132bd9edc39215a623d210e8be9f6b8acfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebb96d15ecc8b5532bb38107bdbcec7b3fa3385a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sin{\\angle A}}{OB}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"93\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/996ff338c32ecebaaf5d945df34ece662715d558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sin{\\angle A}=OB$\" width=\"116\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>The maximum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/1/021edbe01ff10b442e5a5d3248d994ce8036cd57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{\\angle A}$\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/4/a147cb83e3b9fdf390e7d2cf520aa0ba7296fb2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />, so the maximum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/0964c9cf406ef8e5ec8beaa6a92125f2d8f90460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4cbf07cb565d546e3092e98e888c23a3f84f41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME\" title=\"1995 AHSME\">1995 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Pr